<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Explorers Index rises 2.83 percent.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Explorers Index rises 2.83 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Perth stockbroker Eyres Reed Ltd said its Australian Explorers Index rose 103.8 points or 2.83 percent in the week to Friday. The All Ordinaries index fell 1.02 percent. Changes, in percent:</p>
<p>	    Feb 28  Feb 21   pct   1 Month  pct    1 Year  pct</p>
<p>Explorers 3775.1  3671.3 (+2.83) 3547.1 (+6.43)  2671.7 (+41.30)</p>
<p>ASX Gold  1791.5  1803.5 (-0.67) 1733.8 (+3.33)  2107.6 (-15.00)</p>
<p>All Ords  2449.9  2475.3 (-1.02) 2404.2 (+1.90)  2265.7 (+8.13)</p>
<p>Oil &amp; Gas 1538.9  1575.5 (-2.32) 1523.2 (+1.03)  1133.5 (+35.77)</p>
<p>NOTE: The explorers index (base 500, March 1992) tracks the performance of 88 small capitalisation exploration companies.</p>
</text>
